Operational Guide for Corporate End Users

Once network isolation is activated, typing your live .onrender.com URL into a standard browser at home will result in a connection timeout or network access error page. Future users must utilize one of these two corporate ingress channels to safely open the interface:

#
A. Corporate Office Network Access 

Employees must be physically plugged into or connected to the office's secure, white-listed local area network infrastructure (Wi-Fi/Ethernet).
#
B. Secure Corporate VPN (Remote Access)

Remote engineers must initialize their enterprise virtual private network client (such as Cisco AnyConnect, OpenVPN, or Palo Alto Global Protect).

Once the encrypted tunnel securely authenticates against your identity director, the local machine is assigned a private internal routing token, restoring complete visibility to the live metrics portal dashboard.